# 撮合执行报告(match event)进③对拍:现货 NEW / TRADE(taker+maker,全成&部分) / REJECT(IOC 余量)。
# 经 SimpleEventsProcessor 产出 SpotExecutionReport,ER 行按发出顺序逐字段对拍 Java oracle。
#!match=on
CUR id=1 digit=0
CUR id=2 digit=0
SYM_SPOT id=100 base=1 quote=2 baseScale=1 quoteScale=1 taker=5 maker=2
USER uid=1
USER uid=2
BAL uid=1 cur=1 amount=1000000 txid=1
BAL uid=2 cur=2 amount=1000000 txid=2
# maker 挂 ASK 100x10 -> NEW(working)
PLACE oid=1 uid=1 sym=100 price=100 size=10 action=ASK type=GTC
# taker BID 100x6 GTC -> NEW + TRADE taker(FILLED) + TRADE maker(PARTIALLY_FILLED,working)
PLACE oid=2 uid=2 sym=100 price=100 size=6 action=BID type=GTC reserve=100
# taker BID 100x8 IOC:吃掉剩余 maker 4(TRADE),余 4 无对手 -> REJECT
PLACE oid=3 uid=2 sym=100 price=100 size=8 action=BID type=IOC reserve=100
